@startuml
title Idempotent Record State - Stored Status vs Derived Logical State From Code

' 状态图保持默认黑白，不引入模块颜色。
' 重点：明确哪些是当前代码里的持久状态枚举，哪些只是推导状态。

legend right
  代码枚举节点直接显示真实来源：枚举类.枚举值
  示例：ConsumeDecision.ACK / SendFailureType.VALIDATION_ERROR
  LOGICAL = 查询、时间、次数、配置推导，代码枚举中不存在
  RUNTIME = 执行过程节点，代码枚举中不存在
  ACTION = repository / adapter 动作，不是状态枚举
  PROVIDER ACTION = Kafka / Pulsar / RocketMQ 原生确认动作
  PROVIDER CAUSE = Provider 原生返回或异常，不是统一状态枚举
  MESSAGE SEMANTIC = message-component 语义，目前不是持久化枚举
endlegend

state "ABSENT\nLOGICAL\nselect returns no row" as L_ABSENT
state "LOOKUP\nACTION\nquery by namespace + scene + key" as A_LOOKUP
state "INSERT_PROCESSING\nACTION\ninsert row with ownerToken" as A_INSERT_PROCESSING
state "PROCESSING\nIdempotencyStatus.PROCESSING" as DB_PROCESSING
state "SUCCESS\nIdempotencyStatus.SUCCESS" as DB_SUCCESS
state "FAILED\nIdempotencyStatus.FAILED" as DB_FAILED
state "DISCARDED\nIdempotencyStatus.DISCARDED" as DB_DISCARDED

state "PROCESSING_ACTIVE\nLOGICAL\nPROCESSING + processing_expire_time >= now" as L_PROCESSING_ACTIVE
state "PROCESSING_TIMEOUT\nLOGICAL\nPROCESSING + processing_expire_time < now" as L_PROCESSING_TIMEOUT
state "FAILED_RETRYABLE\nLOGICAL\nFAILED + attempt_count < maxAttempts" as L_FAILED_RETRYABLE
state "MAX_ATTEMPTS_EXCEEDED\nLOGICAL\nFAILED + attempt_count >= maxAttempts" as L_MAX_ATTEMPTS
state "RECORD_EXPIRED\nLOGICAL\nexpire_time < now" as L_RECORD_EXPIRED
state "STORAGE_ERROR\nLOGICAL\nrepository/provider exception" as L_STORAGE_ERROR

state "ACQUIRED\nIdempotentAcquireStatus.ACQUIRED" as ACQ_ACQUIRED
state "DUPLICATE_SUCCESS\nIdempotentAcquireStatus.DUPLICATE_SUCCESS" as ACQ_DUP_SUCCESS
state "DUPLICATE_DISCARDED\nIdempotentAcquireStatus.DUPLICATE_DISCARDED" as ACQ_DUP_DISCARDED
state "PROCESSING\nIdempotentAcquireStatus.PROCESSING" as ACQ_PROCESSING
state "REJECTED\nIdempotentAcquireStatus.REJECTED" as ACQ_REJECTED
state "STORAGE_ERROR\nIdempotentAcquireStatus.STORAGE_ERROR" as ACQ_STORAGE_ERROR

state "UPDATED\nIdempotencyWriteStatus.UPDATED\n(markSuccess)" as W_SUCCESS_UPDATED
state "UPDATED\nIdempotencyWriteStatus.UPDATED\n(markFailed)" as W_FAILED_UPDATED
state "STALE_OWNER\nIdempotencyWriteStatus.STALE_OWNER" as W_STALE_OWNER
state "ALREADY_FINAL\nIdempotencyWriteStatus.ALREADY_FINAL" as W_ALREADY_FINAL
state "PROVIDER_ERROR\nIdempotencyWriteStatus.PROVIDER_ERROR" as W_PROVIDER_ERROR

state "CAS_TAKEOVER\nACTION\nupdate ownerToken where PROCESSING timeout" as A_CAS_TAKEOVER
state "CAS_REACQUIRE_FAILED\nACTION\nupdate FAILED -> PROCESSING" as A_CAS_REACQUIRE_FAILED
state "MARK_SUCCESS\nACTION\nmarkSuccess(ownerToken)" as A_MARK_SUCCESS
state "MARK_FAILED\nACTION\nmarkFailed(ownerToken)" as A_MARK_FAILED
state "MARK_DISCARDED\nACTION\nmarkDiscarded(ownerToken)" as A_MARK_DISCARDED
state "CLEANUP_DELETE\nACTION\ndelete expired record" as A_CLEANUP_DELETE

[*] --> A_LOOKUP
A_LOOKUP --> L_ABSENT : no row
L_ABSENT --> A_INSERT_PROCESSING
A_INSERT_PROCESSING --> DB_PROCESSING
DB_PROCESSING --> ACQ_ACQUIRED : return acquire result

A_LOOKUP --> DB_SUCCESS : row.status=SUCCESS
DB_SUCCESS --> ACQ_DUP_SUCCESS : return acquire result

A_LOOKUP --> DB_DISCARDED : adapter identifies discarded semantic
DB_DISCARDED --> ACQ_DUP_DISCARDED : return acquire result

A_LOOKUP --> DB_PROCESSING : row.status=PROCESSING
DB_PROCESSING --> L_PROCESSING_ACTIVE : processing_expire_time >= now
L_PROCESSING_ACTIVE --> ACQ_PROCESSING : another owner is processing
DB_PROCESSING --> L_PROCESSING_TIMEOUT : processing_expire_time < now
L_PROCESSING_TIMEOUT --> A_CAS_TAKEOVER
A_CAS_TAKEOVER --> DB_PROCESSING : CAS success, new ownerToken
A_CAS_TAKEOVER --> ACQ_PROCESSING : CAS failed / another owner won

A_LOOKUP --> DB_FAILED : row.status=FAILED
DB_FAILED --> L_FAILED_RETRYABLE : attempt_count < maxAttempts
L_FAILED_RETRYABLE --> A_CAS_REACQUIRE_FAILED
A_CAS_REACQUIRE_FAILED --> DB_PROCESSING : CAS success
A_CAS_REACQUIRE_FAILED --> A_LOOKUP : CAS failed, re-query
DB_FAILED --> L_MAX_ATTEMPTS : attempt_count >= maxAttempts
L_MAX_ATTEMPTS --> ACQ_REJECTED : failurePolicy decides retry/discard/dlq later

A_LOOKUP --> L_STORAGE_ERROR : repository exception
L_STORAGE_ERROR --> ACQ_STORAGE_ERROR

DB_PROCESSING --> A_MARK_SUCCESS : handler ACK
A_MARK_SUCCESS --> W_SUCCESS_UPDATED : ownerToken matches
W_SUCCESS_UPDATED --> DB_SUCCESS
A_MARK_SUCCESS --> W_STALE_OWNER : ownerToken mismatch
A_MARK_SUCCESS --> W_ALREADY_FINAL : already SUCCESS/FAILED
A_MARK_SUCCESS --> W_PROVIDER_ERROR : repository error
W_STALE_OWNER --> ACQ_STORAGE_ERROR : caller returns RETRY
W_ALREADY_FINAL --> ACQ_STORAGE_ERROR : caller returns RETRY
W_PROVIDER_ERROR --> ACQ_STORAGE_ERROR : caller returns RETRY

DB_PROCESSING --> A_MARK_FAILED : handler exception/RETRY/transaction rollback
A_MARK_FAILED --> W_FAILED_UPDATED
W_FAILED_UPDATED --> DB_FAILED
A_MARK_FAILED --> W_STALE_OWNER
A_MARK_FAILED --> W_PROVIDER_ERROR

DB_PROCESSING --> A_MARK_DISCARDED : handler DISCARD / failurePolicy=DISCARD
A_MARK_DISCARDED --> DB_DISCARDED : message consume terminal semantic
A_MARK_DISCARDED --> W_STALE_OWNER
A_MARK_DISCARDED --> W_PROVIDER_ERROR

DB_SUCCESS --> L_RECORD_EXPIRED : expire_time < now
DB_FAILED --> L_RECORD_EXPIRED : expire_time < now
DB_DISCARDED --> L_RECORD_EXPIRED : expire_time < now
L_RECORD_EXPIRED --> A_CLEANUP_DELETE
A_CLEANUP_DELETE --> L_ABSENT

note right of DB_PROCESSING
  当前 idempotent-api 的真实持久状态枚举：IdempotencyStatus.PROCESSING。
  它应携带 ownerToken / version / processingExpireTime。
end note

note right of DB_DISCARDED
  当前 idempotent-component 已正式持久化 IdempotencyStatus.DISCARDED。
  message-component 的 markDiscarded(...) 与 DUPLICATE_DISCARDED
  对应该终态。
end note

note right of L_PROCESSING_TIMEOUT
  逻辑推导状态，不应写入 status 字段。
  由 PROCESSING + processing_expire_time < now 推导，直接 CAS 抢占即可。
end note

note right of L_RECORD_EXPIRED
  生命周期过期，不建议覆盖原本 SUCCESS/FAILED 的业务历史状态。
  清理任务可直接按 expire_time 删除。
end note
@enduml
